{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":" 这是飞相对士角炮布局经常出现的一个局面。1990年8月超级明星南北对抗赛中，胡荣华与李来群之战，胡此时走马三进四，李应车9进1。炮二平四炮8进3，马四进三车9平6，仕六进五炮8进1。黑方子力出动快，结构好，足可满意。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b6","comment":"徐天红进炮封车，显然是进行了研究后弈出的新变。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":" 不怕黑方挺卒捉炮，上士准备尽快开出贴身车，这是进炮封车的续着。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"飞象固防，引而不发，老练。如走卒3进1捉炮，炮八平三车2进9，马七退八卒3进l，车一平四。红贴身车开出后，黑河头将受到攻击，红方占优。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5c7","comment":"退马看似失先，实则黑退马后，可保持阵形严整，且有车9平8和卒7进1两路争先手段。黑马曲折迂回弈来意味深长。此时如走马4进3，马三进二卒7进1，马二进三卒7进1，车四进三，红有车四平六和炮八进一的进攻手段，黑棋不利","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5c4","comment":"如图形势黑方挺卒捉炮，准备以车换双，算准换双后有马8进7和卒3进1的双重威胁，演变下去黑方有利．","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6i6","comment":" 天红乐意地以双换车，因为他认为得车后形势不错。而我认为天红此时走兵七进一弃炮才是最佳选择。\r\n\r\n变化如下：\r\n车2进3 ,车八进六,\r\n马4退2，兵三进一,\r\n象5进7，兵七进一红方弃子后，子力位置好，且有过河兵助战，形势不差。\r\n\r\n 赛后复盘交流时，天红仍然认为得车是很好的选择，看来两人对这一局面的认识是仁者见仁、智者见智了。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i6h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b5","comment":" 退车捉马使黑方没有机会走马8进7，正确。如走兵七进一吃卒，黑马8进7后，红有两种应法，演变如下：\r\n\r\n（一）车八退四卒5进1，车五进一车9平8，车八平六车8进7，士五退四炮g进2，黑方得子胜定。\r\n\r\n（二）兵三进一车9平8，炮二进三象5进7，车五平三马4进6，黑方得子后还有强大的攻势，红方输定了。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5b8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"阻止红车右移，以达到攻击红空虚右翼的目的，紧要之着","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3i4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i5i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g5","comment":"挺兵吃卒，使黑马得机卧槽扩大了优势。应走车八退三马4\r\n退3，车八平四卒3进1，马七退八。黑棋难以组织有威胁的攻势，仅凭过河卒而稍占优势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b8b5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5h3","comment":"弃马抢攻，着法凶悍。这是天红未曾预料到的。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b5d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e0f0","comment":"如走炮四退一车9平6，帅五平四车6进6，车七平三炮9平6，黑方大占优势．","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5f5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2g0","comment":"正确的防守。如走车七退一车8进9，帅四进一炮6平8 ,\r\n立即构成杀势。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0e2","comment":"应走车七平三车8平7，帅四进一卒3进1，车三退二，这\r\n样防守较为顽强。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i4i5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0i0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d7f7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f5h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f7f9","comment":"以下红必须走车二进三解杀，黑接走马5进3后再退车叫杀\r\n即可取胜。所以红方放弃续弈。\r\n\r\n柳大华评注","defaultIndex":0,"next":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}}